  "review_questions": [
    "Does each drop reason match its candidate: a one-off explained by its situation (C1), a failure a tool or check could prevent (C2), or text the skill already states (C3)?",
    "Do the kept changes (C4, C5) rest on the observed sessions, with each reason naming those sessions?",
    "Where a check, script or tool would prevent a candidate's failure, does the decision route it there instead of leaving it as prose?"
  ]
